  "claims": [
    {
      "text": "Fang Yuan obtains Fixed Luck from Ma Hong Yun’s soul while escaping, and narration places the move inside all living beings luck from Giant Sun Immortal Venerable’s true inheritance. Its effect is to make one’s luck unwavering and not easily influenced. He treats it as the answer to Connect Luck’s weakness: when linked luck rises, part of gains such as those from burning soul bursting luck would otherwise be split to the people he is connected with.",
      "chapters": [
        1415
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "citation_unchecked",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "intro",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
      "mentions": [
        "char_fang_yuan",
        "char_ma_hong_yun",
        "char_giant_sun_immortal_venerable",
        "gu_connect_luck"
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "The original core pair is stubborn Immortal Gu and rule path Immortal Gu Main. After Fang Yuan’s modification, the move uses precaution Immortal Gu and rule path Immortal Gu Big instead. Precaution Immortal Gu was already his, and Big came from Purple Mountain True Monarch. His luck path attainment is not grandmaster, so the change only succeeds partly: even with no casting mistakes, activation can still fail, and he cannot fully repair that flaw.",
      "chapters": [
        1415
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
